---
import {Wind, Sparkles, Flame, Brain} from 'lucide-astro';
---
<section id="servicios" class="py-20 bg-gray-50 dark:bg-gray-950 transition-colors duration-300">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4">
        
        <div class="text-center mb-12">
            <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold text-gray-900 dark:text-white mb-2">
                Nuestros Servicios
            </h2>
            <p class="text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 max-w-md mx-auto text-sm sm:text-base">
                Elige el nivel de protección y cuidado que necesita tu consola.
            </p>
        </div>

        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4 max-w-4xl mx-auto mb-16">
            
            <div class="flex gap-3 p-4 rounded-xl border border-amber-200 bg-amber-50 text-amber-900 dark:border-amber-900/30 dark:bg-amber-950/20 dark:text-amber-400">
                <span class="text-xl shrink-0">🪳</span>
                <div>
                    <h4 class="font-bold text-sm uppercase tracking-wide mb-1">Aviso Importante</h4>
                    <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm leading-relaxed">
                        Si la consola presenta infestación de insectos o plagas, se aplicará un **cobro extra** obligatorio por concepto de sanitización y riesgo de contaminación de herramientas.
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="flex gap-3 p-4 rounded-xl border border-green-200 bg-green-50 text-green-900 dark:border-green-900/30 dark:bg-green-950/20 dark:text-green-400">
                <span class="text-xl shrink-0">🧟‍♂️</span>
                <div>
                    <h4 class="font-bold text-sm uppercase tracking-wide mb-1">Zona de Entrega</h4>
                    <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm leading-relaxed">
                        Toma en cuenta que nuestro zombie repartidor **va a pie** (y no se mueve muy rápido que digamos). Consulta la cobertura de recolección local antes de agendar CDMX.
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>

        </div>

        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-8">

            <div class="flex flex-col p-6 rounded-2xl bg-white border-2 border-green-500 dark:bg-gray-900 shadow-md transition-all duration-300 relative overflow-hidden">

                <span class="absolute top-0 right-0 bg-green-500 text-white text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wider px-3 py-1 rounded-bl-xl">Recomendado</span>

                <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center bg-gray-100 text-gray-700 dark:bg-gray-800 dark:text-gray-300 text-2xl mb-4 font-bold">
                    <Wind class="w-6 h-6 text-gray-700 dark:text-red-500"/>
                </div>

                <div class="mb-4">
                    <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white mb-1">Mantenimiento Preventivo</h3>
                    <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400">Evitar el sobrecalentamiento, reducir el ruido y prolongar la vida útil de la consola.</p>
                </div>

                <div class="mt-2 grow">
                    <ul class="space-y-2.5 text-sm text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300">
                        <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
                            <Brain class=" text-pink-500" />
                            <span class="text-green-700 dark:text-white">Desamble Completo</span> 
                        </li>
                        <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
                            <Brain class=" text-pink-500" />
                            <span class="text-green-700 dark:text-white">Limpieza Profunda</span> 
                        </li>
                        <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
                            <Brain class=" text-pink-500" />
                            <span class="text-green-700 dark:text-white">Cambio de Compuestos Termicos</span> 
                        </li>
                        <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
                            <Brain class=" text-pink-500" />
                            <span class="text-green-700 dark:text-white">Pruebas de Estres</span> 
                        </li>
                    </ul>
                </div>

                <div class="mt-auto pt-6 flex items-baseline justify-between">
                    <span class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-gray-400 dark:text-gray-500">
                        Costo del servicio
                    </span>
                    <div class="flex items-baseline gap-1">
                        <span class="text-xl font-bold text-green-600 dark:text-green-400">$</span>
                        <span class="text-3xl font-black text-gray-900 dark:text-white tracking-tight">
                            300-350
                        </span>
                        <span class="text-xs font-medium text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400">
                            MXN
                        </span>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="flex flex-col p-6 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-gray-200 dark:bg-gray-900 dark:border-gray-800 shadow-sm transition-all duration-300 hover:shadow-md hover:border-green-500/50 dark:hover:border-green-500/50">
                <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center bg-gray-100 text-gray-700 dark:bg-gray-800 dark:text-gray-300 text-2xl mb-4 font-bold">
                    <Sparkles class="w-6 h-6 text-gray-700 dark:text-red-500" />
                </div>

                <div class="mb-4">
                    <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white mb-1">Mantenimiento Correctivo</h3>
                    <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400">Se aplica cuando la consola ya presenta fallas de encendido, video, lectura o rendimiento.</p>
                </div>

                <div class="mt-2 grow">
                    <ul class="space-y-2.5 text-sm text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300">
                        <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
                            <Brain class=" text-pink-500" />
                            <span class="text-green-700 dark:text-white">Reparación de consolas que no encienden</span> 
                        </li>
                        <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
                            <Brain class=" text-pink-500" />
                            <span class="text-green-700 dark:text-white">Reparación de fallas de video / HDMI</span> 
                        </li>
                        <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
                            <Brain class=" text-pink-500" />
                            <span class="text-green-700 dark:text-white">Reparación de fuente de poder</span> 
                        </li> 
                        <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
                            <Brain class=" text-pink-500" />
                            <span class="text-green-700 dark:text-white">Problemas de actualización</span> 
                        </li>
                    </ul>
                </div>

                <div class="mt-auto pt-6 flex items-baseline justify-between">
                    <span class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-gray-400 dark:text-gray-500">
                        Costo del servicio
                    </span>
                    <div class="flex items-baseline gap-1">
                        <span class="text-xl font-bold text-green-600 dark:text-green-400">$</span>
                        <span class="text-3xl font-black text-gray-900 dark:text-white tracking-tight">
                            600-1,500
                        </span>
                        <span class="text-xs font-medium text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400">
                            MXN
                        </span>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="flex flex-col p-6 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-gray-200 dark:bg-gray-900 dark:border-gray-800 shadow-sm transition-all duration-300 hover:shadow-md hover:border-green-500/50 dark:hover:border-green-500/50">
                
                
                <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center bg-green-100 text-green-700 dark:bg-green-950/50 dark:text-green-400 text-2xl mb-4 font-bold">
                    <Flame class="w-6 h-6 text-gray-700 dark:text-red-500" />
                </div>

                <div class="mb-4">
                    <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white mb-1">Mantenimiento a Mandos</h3>
                    <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400">Rendimiento máximo.</p>
                </div>

                <div class="mt-2 grow">
                    <ul class="space-y-2.5 text-sm text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300">
                        <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
                            <Brain class=" text-pink-500" />
                            <span class="text-green-700 dark:text-white">Cambio de Joystick</span> 
                        </li>
                        <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
                            <Brain class=" text-pink-500" />
                            <span class="text-green-700 dark:text-white">Reparación de gatillos</span> 
                        </li>
                        <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
                            <Brain class=" text-pink-500" />
                            <span class="text-green-700 dark:text-white">Puerto de carga</span> 
                        </li>
                    </ul>
                </div>

                <div class="mt-auto pt-6 flex items-baseline justify-between">
                    <span class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-gray-400 dark:text-gray-500">
                        Costo del servicio
                    </span>
                    <div class="flex items-baseline gap-1">
                        <span class="text-xl font-bold text-green-600 dark:text-green-400">$</span>
                        <span class="text-3xl font-black text-gray-900 dark:text-white tracking-tight">
                            200-500
                        </span>
                        <span class="text-xs font-medium text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400">
                            MXN
                        </span>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

        </div>
    </div>
</section>